'GREEN DRAGONS'
Green dragons are notorious, even among evil dragons, for their cruel
natures and vicious tempers. They are cunning opponents, and only follow
leaders whom they respect. They prefer trickery and magic to all-out
combat.  Green dragons lair in wild, forested areas, usually underground.
There, in large chambers, they pass days counting their piles of treasure.
Those old enough to have mastered spells, used their magic first if they
are attacked or threatened. They prefer not to get their claws dirty.
Green dragons can breathe a cloud of chlorine gas.
